 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "I Decide My Fate, Your Highness"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "Denka, Unmei wa Watashi ga Kimemasu"
   },
   {
    "ja": "殿下、運命は私が決めます"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Betrayed by her family and sentenced to die as an experiment, Phillie Lutner awakens the Tarot Cards of Fate, a Divine Relic with the power to rewrite time. Determined to reclaim her life, she uses their magic to escape her former fiancé, outsmart her scheming half-sister, and claim her rightful place as heir to the House of Lutner. But as she uncovers a dark plot surrounding the Relics, one question remains - can she break free from the past and build a future with those she loves, or is she doomed to repeat her tragic fate?"
  },
